        "created_at": "2014-02-12T04:54:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"lynkfox\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/48/1997_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lynkfox:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Its on the wiki <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"http://sotm.wikidot.com/heroes:haka\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://sotm.wikidot.com/heroes:haka</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>On that subject, will you be adding detail on the Vengeance villains' game abilities to the wiki?&nbsp; Are you waiting until it's generally available to do so?</p>",
