        "created_at": "2014-02-12T05:27:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure what you mean. None of the other villains have anything like game abilities posted, and there isn't really anything for the vengeance villains. I've made a very potent point of not posting entire card text - Powers/Incap abilities are fine (because its like each is a promo card, and those are freely provided with blessing - and are useless without the decks), but there doesn't seem to have had any reason to post the entire setup text of &nbsp;villains.</p>",
